        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KQ01YcGhkRFZJUjJGek1FZFhNblJMZGs1TVVWRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401387618eced:0x2b2082fd854b3721"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ7ewYdjgBBDQRITdLhf2CICs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1Qk9URlZiMkpLYW1KeWJubFhOMFp3ZVZaNk5GRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "TUNA MELT HKD 80\n酸種麵包表層與邊緣烤到金黃酥脆, 內裡柔軟濕潤, 切達起司牽絲延展, 鮪魚的鮮味與微微鹹味中和起司奶香味, 紅洋蔥 芹菜 酸黃瓜帶出輕辛與清新口感, 並融入蛋黃醬, 整體味道層次分明, 每口都有麵包與餡料, 不會太乾也不會太濕重。\n\nBLACK COFFEE HKD 30\n杯中深褐色澤均勻, 無浮渣, 味道是咖啡豆本身風味, 微果酸堅果風, 純粹回甘, 不會太稀薄有一定溫潤感。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
